# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this file `COPY . .` ships the host's node_modules (405 MB) into the
# image on top of the dependencies the build already installed, so every
# dependency lands twice. dist/ is excluded for the same reason: the image
# builds its own from source rather than trusting whatever the host last built.

node_modules
dist
coverage

# Never bake secrets into a published image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Not needed at runtime.
tests
.git
.gitignore
*.md
